{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X为了突出重点压缩了部分心理因果和犹疑过程，例如S07少了“早知道这样，自己还会走吗”的反问，S10也弱化了舍不得与不敢回去之间的理由，Y在人物心理交代上更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮重点、短句分段和按音乐小节出现的感受，让观众可以先抓住人物每一阶段在想什么，再随着音乐变化感受情绪的起伏，不必一次面对整堆描述。它的感受也更具体，能把旋律、节奏、音色、身体反应和人物心理联系起来，前后反复出现的舞曲、旧歌等线索又加强了整体连贯性。Y的优势是叙事因果交代得更充分，但部分时段右侧感受词集中堆叠，容易让观众忙于阅读，反而错过音乐正在发生的细微变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ec69eb3-e81d-4b84-88c4-7f5de56300f4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210116940068Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:02:48.295098+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3377f63c5028a60793565b050e05a606387b4f55a7ea1d94c1e9c645ae1fa301", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa